1905
01:00:37,900 --> 01:00:40,700
- On the tenth
sentence, kiss her.

1906
01:00:42,167 --> 01:00:43,967
- Oh, sure, take advice from
long-time bachelor Lee Van

1907
01:00:43,967 --> 01:00:45,433
Cleef.

1908
