Kick Me sign off your butt.

1909
01:00:50,133 --> 01:00:52,067
- [Tom] That's your
paper moon, buddy.

1910
01:00:52,067 --> 01:00:53,600
- Now you're ready.

1911
01:00:54,800 --> 01:00:55,600
- Thanks.

1912
