- [Man] Political assassination.

1944
01:01:45,700 --> 01:01:47,133
Paid killers.

1945
01:01:47,133 --> 01:01:48,100
- [Tom] Killer.

1946
01:01:48,100 --> 01:01:49,633
- A young man named Okasa.

1947
01:01:49,633 --> 01:01:50,600
