fridge if you need it.

2017
01:04:22,633 --> 01:04:23,800
Bye.

2018
01:04:23,800 --> 01:04:24,767
- Boy, you know,
Malcolm Forbes really

2019
01:04:24,767 --> 01:04:25,900
